{"id":"bebido","lemma":"bebido","pos":"adj","rank":2257,"glosses":["drunk"],"ipa":"/beˈbido/","forms":{"feminine":"bebida","masculinePlural":"bebidos","femininePlural":"bebidas"},"formAudio":{"bebida":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bebida.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Pareces estar bebido.","en":"You seem to be drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354385","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Estamos demasiado bebidos.","en":"We're too drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461329","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"too much"},null]},{"text":"He bebido demasiado café hoy.","en":"I've drunk way too much coffee today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515867","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"too much"},{"g":"coffee"},{"g":"today, tonight"}]},{"text":"Estoy un poco bebido.","en":"I am a bit drunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442373","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"a bit"]]},{"text":"¿Qué has bebido?","en":"What did you drink?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/48598","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]}]}